e\">この銘柄は本日の分析対象外です（今夜の厳選・出尽くしサイン・レーティング変化・注目開示などの注目銘柄のみ、毎晩の実行で場中の5分足を取得して分析します）。</div><div class=\"spwrap\"><div class=\"nhead\">値動きと長期支持帯<span class=\"spbtns\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '1')\">1年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn on\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '3')\">3年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '10')\">10年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, 'all')\">全期間(26年)</button></span></div><div class=\"spark spv\" data-sp=\"1\" style=\"display:none\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 110\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:100%; height:auto; background:#fffdf6; border-radius:8px;\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"97.2\" width=\"320\" height=\"2\" fill=\"#c62f2f\" opacity=\"0.12\"/><polyline points=\"4.0,36.2 9.1,36.2 14.2,39.4 19.3,37.8 24.5,34.9 29.6,42.3 34.7,43.0 39.8,43.6 44.9,40.7 50.0,43.3 55.1,47.5 60.3,45.2 65.4,40.1 70.5,42.6 75.6,39.4 80.7,36.2 85.8,35.6 91.0,31.4 96.1,30.4 101.2,26.6 106.3,23.4 111.4,28.8 116.5,27.9 121.6,23.0 126.8,12.8 131.9,36.9 137.0,37.2 142.1,32.4 147.2,35.6 152.3,41.3 157.4,35.2 162.6,38.1 167.7,34.6 172.8,37.2 177.9,36.2 183.0,37.5 188.1,39.7 193.2,43.9 198.4,42.3 203.5,41.0 208.6,40.7 213.7,34.6 218.8,42.6 223.9,62.2 229.0,74.4 234.2,65.8 239.3,73.1 244.4,73.1 249.5,75.1 254.6,87.9 259.7,36.2 264.9,91.5 270.0,93.1 275.1,90.2 280.2,90.8 285.3,87.6 290.4,87.6 295.5,90.2 300.7,88.2 305.8,93.1 310.9,94.0 316.0,96.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1c1c1e\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><path d=\"M 259.7 48.2 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 275.1 102.2 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><circle cx=\"316.0\" cy=\"96.0\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#1c1c1e\"/></svg></div><div class=\"spark spv\" data-sp=\"3\" style=\"display:\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 110\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:100%; height:auto; background:#fffdf6; border-radius:8px;\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"97.2\" width=\"320\" height=\"2\" fill=\"#c62f2f\" opaci